{"kind":"report","text":"Dimension check supports a 16-seat routine coworking target and an 18-seat dense kitchen-inactive layout for field mock-up, not a certified occupancy. Nine bench stations use 850 mm pitch along the available 7.65 m portion. A long 800 mm wide movable table can supply six west-side seats plus a north end seat in single-sided mode (16 total), or four per side plus a north end seat in dense mode (18 total). Dense section assumes 600 mm occupied chair projection, 550 mm secondary gap between bench and table chair backs and 965 mm main route beside the inactive kitchen. Single-sided mode separates the public west route (965 mm) from a roughly 1150 mm east working aisle. Cafe requires separate service/queue/equipment layout; do not apply 18-seat mode during active food service. Reviewed MA food-code 2-103.11(B): unnecessary persons excluded from preparation, storage and warewashing areas. No blanket full-height kitchen enclosure established by reviewed food code; propose open but controlled zone subject to local health/building/fire review. Cafe equipment was not included in prior tight appliance-run fit.","body":{"promise":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:8f28fa78f9da3b7f69dce05952cabdf3e1c359f6"}}